# Auto git publish

After completing a meaningful set of code changes in this project:

1. Commit with a clear message (why over what).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch so Vercel redeploys.
3. Do this without asking for confirmation each time.

Still never force-push, never amend published history unless explicitly requested, and never commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).
